WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.151 --> 00:00:01.388
IMAN VELLANI
Ms. Marvel, baby.

00:00:01.439 --> 00:00:02.531
MATT LINTZ
This is my shot.

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:05.777
ADIL EL ARBI
Here on the set of Ms. Marvel.

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:08.412
SANA AMANAT
Our actors can do everything.

00:00:10.073 --> 00:00:11.523
MATT LINTZ
I feel exhilarated.

00:00:12.006 --> 00:00:13.007
SAAGAR SHAIKH
I think I'm doing it.

00:00:13.058 --> 00:00:14.851
I'm trying to channel so much energy.

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:17.155
SANA AMANAT
We go from a dance sequence...

00:00:17.406 --> 00:00:18.490
[Cheering]

00:00:18.541 --> 00:00:19.464
SANA AMANAT
...to a fight sequence

00:00:19.515 --> 00:00:20.829
in a matter of 24 hours.

00:00:21.626 --> 00:00:22.543
RISH SHAH
That was fun!

00:00:23.207 --> 00:00:24.470
ADIL EL ARBI
There's so much chemistry

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.176
we feel that they're really like family.

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:27.075
YASMEEN FLETCHER
It feels like I have known them

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:28.005
like my whole life.

00:00:28.056 --> 00:00:30.056
This has been insane,
but I wouldn't trade it.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:32.466
IMAN VELLANI
And we're high fiving in

00:00:32.517 --> 00:00:34.521
slow motion...

00:00:34.572 --> 00:00:35.799
BILLAL FALLAH
It feels like there is this

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:37.751
new generation coming up.

00:00:37.934 --> 00:00:39.934
♪♪

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:46.370
IMAN VELLANI
Why you gotta make me laugh so much?

00:00:46.421 --> 00:00:47.355
[Laughing]

00:00:48.407 --> 00:00:49.545
SANA AMANAT
Iman Vellani is truly

00:00:49.596 --> 00:00:50.632
the heart of the show.

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:51.687
IMAN VELLANI
It's the greatest day of my life.

00:00:51.738 --> 00:00:53.578
I was having so much fun
and I wanted to cherish

00:00:53.628 --> 00:00:55.187
every single second of being there.

00:00:55.513 --> 00:00:57.708
BISHA K. ALI
She's just very fundamentally lovable.

00:00:57.759 --> 00:00:59.563
SANA AMANAT
It is just a testament of their talent.

00:00:59.613 --> 00:01:00.552
We have something special.

00:01:00.603 --> 00:01:02.841
Lightning in a bottle is the
best way to describe it.

00:01:03.442 --> 00:01:03.997
ADIL EL ARBI
And...

00:01:04.048 --> 00:01:04.521
IMAN VELLANI
Cut!

